codex
The failure is exactly the reviewer’s TOCTOU/symlink finding: the archive writer opens a predictable sibling path and later unlinks it blindly. I’ll replace that with an exclusive randomized file in the destination directory, track its inode for cleanup, verify the post-replace destination, and add a command-level regression covering both success and injected failure.
